2:T12d2,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/aigc-marketing-content#article","headline":"AIGC for marketing: scaling AI-generated visual content","description":"What is AIGC? AI-generated content is reshaping how marketing teams produce images and video at scale. Here is a plain-English guide to generative AI in content workflows, how Google views AI content, and how a single canvas like Melius turns one brief into on-brand visuals across every model.","url":"https://www.melius.com/blog/aigc-marketing-content","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/aigc-marketing-content"},"datePublished":"2026-07-21","dateModified":"2026-07-21","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Melius Team","url":"https://www.melius.com"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#organization"},"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#website"},"inLanguage":"en-US","image":"https://www.melius.com/images/blog/aigc-marketing-content/cover.webp","timeRequired":"PT8M","wordCount":1181,"articleSection":"Guides","keywords":"Guides"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Blog","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"AIGC for marketing: scaling AI-generated visual content","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog/aigc-marketing-content"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is AIGC?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AIGC stands for AI-generated content: the text, images, audio, and video that generative AI drafts, generates, and edits, rather than a person producing every asset by hand. In marketing it means using AI to scale creative production without scaling headcount. On Melius, AIGC is visual, you describe a shot and generate on-brand images and video across every major model on one canvas."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which AI can generate the best multimedia content?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no single best model, only the one that fits the job in front of you. Different models win at product photography, cinematic video, text inside an image, or fast iteration, so the strongest setup lets you switch between them. Melius routes across every major image, video, and audio model on the same canvas, so you pick per job instead of betting on one provider."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the best generative AI tools for content creation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The best tool depends on the work, but for visual marketing content the strongest option aggregates many models, adds an agent that can plan multi-step jobs, and keeps collaboration and assets in one place. Melius does all three: every frontier model under one subscription, an agent named Mel that builds and runs the pipeline, and a real-time multiplayer canvas where the whole team works."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you automate content creation with AI?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Set up repeatable steps so a brief triggers generation instead of manual work at every stage. On Melius you teach the agent your brand once as reusable skills and templates, then Mel plans the steps, picks a model per step, and runs the pipeline, so producing a campaign's worth of visuals becomes a request rather than a day of clicking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do marketing teams use generative AI without losing brand voice?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Teach the tool your brand once instead of re-explaining it every time. Feed it your guidelines, palette, and reference images so every generation stays on-brand. Melius stores that context plus saved slash-command skills, so the agent applies your look to each image and video automatically rather than drifting from one generation to the next."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is AI-generated content good for SEO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, when it is genuinely useful. Google rewards high-quality content however it is produced and judges it on E-E-A-T (experience, expertise, authoritativeness, trustworthiness), so AIGC that answers the query and reads naturally can rank. Effort is better spent raising quality than trying to evade AI-content detection."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you balance AI and human creativity in content creation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Let AI carry the labor of execution and keep the labor of taste human. Generative AI clears blank-page syndrome and the slow, mechanical parts of production, while strategy, emotional resonance, and final judgment stay with people. Melius is built around that split, so the platform handles generation and editing while you steer the creative direction."}}]}]}7:X
