43:["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]
44:["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Set up repeatable steps so a brief triggers generation instead of manual work at every stage. On Melius you teach the agent your brand once as reusable skills and templates, then Mel plans the steps, picks a model per step, and runs the pipeline, so producing a campaign's worth of visuals becomes a request rather than a day of clicking."}]
45:["$","details","4",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How do marketing teams use generative AI without losing brand voice?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Teach the tool your brand once instead of re-explaining it every time. Feed it your guidelines, palette, and reference images so every generation stays on-brand. Melius stores that context plus saved slash-command skills, so the agent applies your look to each image and video automatically rather than drifting from one generation to the next."}]]}]
46:["$","details","5",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Is AI-generated content good for SEO?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Yes, when it is genuinely useful. Google rewards high-quality content however it is produced and judges it on E-E-A-T (experience, expertise, authoritativeness, trustworthiness), so AIGC that answers the query and reads naturally can rank. Effort is better spent raising quality than trying to evade AI-content detection."}]]}]
47:["$","details","6",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How do you balance AI and human creativity in content creation?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Let AI carry the labor of execution and keep the labor of taste human. Generative AI clears blank-page syndrome and the slow, mechanical parts of production, while strategy, emotional resonance, and final judgment stay with people. Melius is built around that split, so the platform handles generation and editing while you steer the creative direction."}]]}]
49:["$","$L48","post-higgsfield-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-higgsfield-alternative","slug":"higgsfield-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Higgsfield alternative for cinematic AI video","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Higgsfield alternative? Higgsfield nails cinematic camera motion, but teams outgrow its fixed roster and export-to-edit workflow. Here's an honest look at how Melius handles the same work, with every frontier model, an agent that plans multi-step pipelines, and a place to finish the cut.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/higgsfield-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Higgsfield alternative?","answer":"For teams that want more than cinematic camera presets, Melius is the strongest alternative. It routes across every frontier video and image model (Kling, Veo, Sora, Seedance, Nano Banana Pro and more), adds Mel, an agent that plans and wires multi-step work on a shared canvas, supports real-time multiplayer, and keeps every model under one subscription with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage instead of a fixed roster."},{"question":"Does Melius do cinematic camera motion like Higgsfield?","answer":"Melius routes to the same frontier video models that produce cinematic motion, so you describe the shot and Mel writes the per-model prompt each one responds to. Higgsfield's preset virtual camera rig is a genuine specialty, and if that exact preset-driven motion control is your entire workflow it is very good at it. The trade is model breadth and an in-app place to assemble the finished cut."},{"question":"Why do people look for a Higgsfield alternative?","answer":"The most commonly reported reasons are workflow friction: unlimited-mode jobs getting queued behind paid ones, and no in-app editing timeline, so clips get exported to Premiere, DaVinci or CapCut to assemble. Teams also outgrow a fixed model roster and want an agent that plans and runs multi-step work rather than a separate chat surface."},{"question":"Can I assemble a finished video in Melius?","answer":"Yes. Melius has an in-app multi-track editor, so you can generate shots, arrange them, layer audio and export from one place rather than exporting individual clips to a separate editor."},{"question":"Is Melius model-agnostic?","answer":"Yes. Melius runs every major image, video and audio model side by side and lets you pick the right one per shot. Its MCP server is canvas-level, so an external agent like Claude can build and run the canvas itself, not just request a single generation, which is a step beyond a generation-only integration."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-higgsfield-does-well","title":"The specialty"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b792","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b791","text":"Higgsfield earned its following with one thing done unusually well: cinematic camera motion. Its virtual camera rig, motion presets, and VFX library make it fast to turn a still into a crash-zoom, an orbit, or a stylized ad clip, and its Marketing Studio can spin a product URL into a finished spot. If that preset-driven look is the whole job, it is genuinely good at it.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b796","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b793","text":"But a lot of teams outgrow a tool built around one specialty. If you are searching for a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b794","text":"Higgsfield alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b795","text":", it is usually because you want the same frontier model quality without the roster limits or the export-and-assemble-elsewhere workflow, and with an agent that runs the whole pipeline. Here is an honest look at where Higgsfield shines, where teams hit friction, and how Melius approaches the same work.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b798","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b797","text":"What Higgsfield does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-higgsfield-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b800","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b799","text":"Credit where it is due. Higgsfield's camera-motion control is best-in-class, its Soul model keeps a character identity consistent across shots, and its preset and VFX library make polished social output quick. It has also expanded well beyond a single generate box, adding a node-based canvas, team collaboration, and an MCP server. For fast, cinematic ad creative, it is a capable tool.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b802","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b801","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b804","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b803","text":"The recurring complaints are less about output and more about how the product is metered and where the workflow ends.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b807","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b805","text":"\"Unlimited\" that queues. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b806","text":"Users report that unlimited-mode jobs get throttled into a queue while credit-metered jobs run instantly.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b810","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b808","text":"No place to finish the cut. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b809","text":"There is no in-app editing timeline, so you export clips and assemble them in Premiere, DaVinci or CapCut.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b812","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b811","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b814","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b813","text":"Melius is a creative workspace built around model choice and orchestration rather than one signature effect. You generate on a node-based canvas where every prompt, image, video clip and audio track is a connected node, and the output of one flows into the next.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b820","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b817","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b815","text":"Every model, one credit pool. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b816","text":"Kling, Veo, Sora and Seedance for video; Nano Banana Pro, GPT Image and Seedream for images; ElevenLabs and Seed Audio for sound. You pick the right one per shot instead of being limited to a fixed roster, and ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b818","text":"every model draws from a single subscription","marks":["b817"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b819","text":" with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b826","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b823","href":"/blog/brief-to-execution-workflow","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b821","text":"An agent that operates the canvas. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b822","text":"Mel doesn't just generate next to your work. It reads the canvas, picks a model for each step, wires the nodes together and runs them, so a brief like \"product shot, then a five-second cinematic clip\" becomes a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b824","text":"real brief-to-execution pipeline","marks":["b823"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b825","text":". Higgsfield's autonomous agent works as a separate chat surface that triggers its studios, rather than building and running the node graph itself.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b829","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b827","text":"Works where briefs land. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b828","text":"The same agent runs inside Slack, so someone can request a spot, review it, and download the finished cut in a thread. Most tools at best post outputs to Slack while the real work stays in their app.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b832","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b830","text":"A workforce, not one bot. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b831","text":"Run several agents at once, each claiming a visible region of the canvas so teammates can see who is working on what, with real-time multiplayer for the humans too.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b835","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b833","text":"Find every shot you've already made. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b834","text":"Every generation and upload is auto-indexed into a semantic asset library, so you pull back a past shot by describing what's in it instead of digging through folders, the kind of memory a preset-driven generator doesn't keep for you.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b838","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b836","text":"Drive it from your own tools, finish in one place. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b837","text":"The Melius MCP is canvas-level: an external agent like Claude can build and run the canvas itself, not just call a generation endpoint. And an in-app multi-track editor means you assemble the finished cut without leaving for Premiere or CapCut.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b839","rows":[{"_key":"b840","cells":[{"_key":"b841","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b843","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b842","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b844","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b846","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b845","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b847","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b849","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b848","text":"Higgsfield","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b850","cells":[{"_key":"b851","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b853","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b852","text":"Core focus","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b854","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b856","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b855","text":"Agent-run creative workspace","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b857","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b859","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b858","text":"Cinematic video & ad creative","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b860","cells":[{"_key":"b861","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b863","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b862","text":"Model access","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b864","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b866","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b865","text":"Every major image, video & audio model","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b867","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b869","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b868","text":"Curated roster + proprietary models","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b870","cells":[{"_key":"b871","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b873","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b872","text":"Agent operates the canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b874","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b876","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b875","text":"Builds & runs the nodes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b877","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b879","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b878","text":"Separate chat agent","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b880","cells":[{"_key":"b881","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b883","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b882","text":"Agent in Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b884","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b886","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b885","text":"Full workflow in a thread","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b887","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b889","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b888","text":"Posts outputs only","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b890","cells":[{"_key":"b891","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b893","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b892","text":"Multiple agents at once","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b894","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b896","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b895","text":"Yes, with visible presence","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b897","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b899","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b898","text":"One at a time","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b900","cells":[{"_key":"b901","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b903","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b902","text":"Canvas-level MCP","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b904","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b906","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b905","text":"Builds & runs the canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b907","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b909","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b908","text":"Generation-only","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b910","cells":[{"_key":"b911","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b913","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b912","text":"Camera / motion control","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b914","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b916","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b915","text":"Prompt-driven","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b917","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b919","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b918","text":"Dedicated controls (a real strength)","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b921","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b920","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b923","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b922","text":"If Higgsfield's camera rig and character models are the entire reason you're there, they are hard to beat on those axes. But if the bottleneck is throughput, turning briefs into finished, on-brand creative, then an agent that actually operates the canvas, works in Slack, runs many-at-once with visible presence, and is drivable from your own AI tools matters more than any single model knob. That is what Melius is built for.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b928","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b925","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b924","text":"See how your own shots break down across models. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b926","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b925"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b927","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b930","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b929","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b931","items":"$49:props:post:faq"}]}}]
4a:["$","$L48","post-flora-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-flora-alternative","slug":"flora-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Flora alternative for creative teams","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Flora alternative? Flora (Florafauna) and Melius are the two node canvases most often compared, so \"we have a canvas and an agent\" isn't the difference. The real gaps are collaboration, learning curve, and pricing. Here's how Melius handles the same work with true real-time multiplayer.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/flora-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Flora alternative?","answer":"Melius is the closest and strongest Flora alternative. Both are node-based creative canvases that aggregate many models, pair a canvas with an AI agent, and offer real-time multiplayer, so the decision comes down to execution: Melius adds an agent that also runs in Slack, several agents working at once with visible presence, a gentler learning curve because Mel does the node-wiring for you, and every model under one credit pool."},{"question":"How is Melius different from Flora?","answer":"Both have a node canvas, an agent and real-time multiplayer, so the honest differences are concrete. Melius has been stress-tested past 200 nodes on one canvas, where teams report Flora's canvas starting to strain; every asset you generate is semantically searchable instead of filed away to scroll; and the agent runs the full request-to-download loop in Slack with several agents working at once, rather than a single browser-tab assistant."},{"question":"Does Melius have as many models as Flora?","answer":"Both platforms give you the major frontier image, video and audio models in one place, including the Flux family, Nano Banana Pro, Seedream, Kling, Veo, Sora and Seedance. Neither locks you to a single provider; you pick the right model per node."},{"question":"Is Flora the same as Florafauna?","answer":"Yes. Flora is the product from Florafauna (florafauna.ai), and its built-in agent is named FAUNA. When people compare a Flora alternative, they mean this node-based canvas. Melius is the closest like-for-like: a node canvas plus an agent, but with an agent that also runs in Slack and concurrently, a gentler learning curve, and one shared credit pool."},{"question":"Is Melius easier to learn than Flora?","answer":"It aims to be. Flora is explicitly pitched at technical teams comfortable with node systems, and reviewers suggest budgeting a full day before you're productive. Melius keeps the same node power but lets Mel build and wire the graph from a brief, so you can steer in plain language instead of assembling every node by hand."},{"question":"Can Melius handle video work?","answer":"Yes. Melius routes to frontier video models and includes an in-app multi-track editor to assemble the result. Because every model shares one credit pool, you can compare a shot across Kling, Veo and Seedance without juggling separate budgets."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-flora-does-well","title":"What Flora does well"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b933","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b932","text":"Flora and Melius are the two tools most often mentioned in the same breath, and for good reason. Both are node-based creative canvases: you drop text, image, video and audio nodes onto an infinite canvas, wire them together, and build reusable pipelines instead of typing into a single prompt box. Both aggregate dozens of frontier models, and both pair the canvas with an AI agent, FAUNA on Flora, Mel on Melius.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b937","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b934","text":"So a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b935","text":"Flora alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b936","text":" comparison can't lean on \"we have a canvas\", \"we have an agent\" or \"we have multiplayer\", because Flora has all three. The real differences are in execution: how far the agent reaches, the learning curve, and how each one is assembled.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b939","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b938","text":"What Flora does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-flora-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b941","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b940","text":"Flora is a polished, capable tool. Its Style DNA system keeps a look or character consistent across generations, its model coverage is broad, and its build-once, reuse-forever workflows are genuinely powerful for studios producing at scale. It has earned real clients in film, fashion and branding. If you have a technical team that enjoys wiring node graphs by hand, Flora rewards that.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b943","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b942","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b946","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b944","text":"The agent is the headline, and the soft spot. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b945","text":"On paper FAUNA is a full canvas agent. In practice, reviewers and users report it often needs correcting on multi-step briefs, and it lives only in the browser tab, no Slack, no concurrent agents, no team-taught skills. It exists; the question is how much it actually carries.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b949","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b947","text":"A steep learning curve. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b948","text":"Flora explicitly targets teams comfortable with node-based systems, and reviewers suggest investing a full day before you're productive, even if you already know Figma.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b952","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b950","text":"A canvas that stalls as it grows. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b951","text":"Flora is fine on small graphs, but teams report it bogging down as a project scales, well before the node counts a real multi-scene campaign reaches, so the canvas becomes the ceiling.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b955","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b953","text":"Files to browse, not assets to search. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b954","text":"Flora keeps your outputs in a file library, but there's no semantic search, so finding the shot you made last week means scrolling, not describing it.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b957","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b956","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b959","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b958","text":"Both tools have a node canvas, an agent and multiplayer, so the honest comparison is the concrete places they diverge, not who has an agent.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b962","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b960","text":"Scale that holds up past 50 nodes. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b961","text":"Melius has been stress-tested past 200 nodes on a single canvas, so a multi-scene project stays responsive as the graph fills up, exactly where teams report Flora's canvas starting to strain.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b965","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b963","text":"Search with AI. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b964","text":"Every generation and upload is auto-indexed by what is actually in it, so you can search \"the neon product shot on black\" and land on it. Flora gives you files to scroll; there is no semantic search over your own library.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b968","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b966","text":"The agent works where Flora's can't. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b967","text":"FAUNA lives in a single browser tab, one agent, one step at a time. Mel runs the full request-approve-download loop inside Slack, and several agents can work the same canvas at once with visible presence, so the difference isn't 'has an agent', it's how far it reaches and how many run.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b971","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b969","text":"Teach it your brand once. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b970","text":"Store brand instructions plus reference images and save custom slash-command skills, and the agent applies them to every generation, instead of re-selecting reference nodes each turn.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b977","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b974","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b972","text":"Every model, one subscription. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b973","text":"Image, video and audio models share ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b975","text":"a single subscription","marks":["b974"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b976","text":" with unlimited agent usage, so comparing a shot across Kling, Veo and Seedance is a routing choice, not a budgeting headache.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b978","rows":[{"_key":"b979","cells":[{"_key":"b980","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b982","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b981","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b983","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b985","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b984","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b986","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b988","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b987","text":"Flora","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b989","cells":[{"_key":"b990","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b992","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b991","text":"Node-based canvas + agent","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b993","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b995","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b994","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b996","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b998","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b997","text":"Yes (FAUNA)","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b999","cells":[{"_key":"b1000","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1002","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1001","text":"Canvas scale","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1003","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1005","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1004","text":"Stress-tested past 200 nodes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1006","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1008","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1007","text":"Strains as the graph grows","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1009","cells":[{"_key":"b1010","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1012","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1011","text":"Find your own assets","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1013","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1015","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1014","text":"Semantic asset search","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1016","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1018","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1017","text":"File library, no semantic search","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1019","cells":[{"_key":"b1020","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1022","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1021","text":"Agent in Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1023","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1025","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1024","text":"Full workflow in a thread","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1026","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1028","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1027","text":"Browser tab only","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1029","cells":[{"_key":"b1030","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1032","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1031","text":"Multiple agents at once","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1033","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1035","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1034","text":"Yes, with visible presence","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1036","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1038","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1037","text":"One at a time","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1039","cells":[{"_key":"b1040","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1042","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1041","text":"Team-taught brand","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1043","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1045","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1044","text":"Context + slash skills","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1046","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1048","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1047","text":"Saved styles / per-turn refs","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1050","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1049","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1052","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1051","text":"Flora is a strong tool for a technical team that lives in node graphs. If your team needs an agent that reliably carries multi-step work into Slack, several agents on one canvas at once, and brand taught once as reusable skills, Melius is built for exactly that.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1057","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1054","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1053","text":"Try the canvas with your own team. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1055","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b1054"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1056","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1059","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1058","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1064","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1061","href":"/blog/best-ai-creative-canvases-image-generation","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1060","text":"For a broader comparison, read our guide to ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1062","text":"the best AI creative canvases for image generation","marks":["b1061"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1063","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b1065","items":"$4a:props:post:faq"}]}}]
